message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "DNA Mutation Effect Predictor"
abstract: >-
  A research tool for classifying human missense mutations as likely
  pathogenic or benign using ESM-2 protein embeddings and population
  annotations. Includes a terminal interface, a Streamlit dashboard, and
  reproducible evaluation artifacts.
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-19
license: MIT
